## Why This Is Asked

This probes security-first real-time design under multi-tenancy, focusing on trusted execution, key management, and safe rollback under partitions.

## Key Concepts

- TEEs and attestation for secure compute
- Deterministic tenant routing and per-tenant model/versioning
- Envelope encryption with per-tenant KEKs and rotation
- In-enclave streaming processing and leakage minimization
- Canary rollout, drift testing, and backfill under partitions

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode: fetch KEK, decrypt features in enclave, and score
async function scoreTenantEvent(event, tenantId){
  const kek = await kms.getTenantKey(tenantId);
  const plain = decryptInHost(event.encryptedFeatures, kek);
  const score = enclave.computeScore(tenantId, plain, getModelVersion(tenantId));
  return score;
}
```

